    "image_with_text_CxRpWb": {
      "type": "image-with-text",
      "blocks": {
        "heading_8fzykH": {
          "type": "heading",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Exploring the Customization and Technology of Tamper-Evident Labels",
            "highlight_style": "none",
            "highlight_font_style": "italic",
            "highlight_style_color": "",
            "highlight_text_color": "",
            "heading_size": "h2"
          }
        },
        "text_rbjjCW": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Ensuring your products’ security is crucial for your business’s success. Tampering not only jeopardizes consumer safety but also damages your brand’s reputation. That’s where tamper-evident labels come in.</p><p>According to Neil Doniger, co-owner of NADCO Tapes and Labels, “Tamper-evident labels are vital for protecting products and upholding brand trust.” But these labels have even more importance than meets the eye.</p><p>From simple packaging tape with distinctive hazard stripes to advanced carton-sealing tape that reveals a message when removed, tamper-evident labels help confirm that products haven’t been opened or tampered with.</p><p>Visible tamper-evident features instill confidence in consumers, assuring them of product authenticity and safety.</p><p>Whether it’s pharmaceuticals, food & beverage, electronics, or cosmetics, tamper-evident labels communicate a commitment to quality and integrity.</p>",
            "subtext_color": true
          }
        }
      },
      "block_order": [
        "heading_8fzykH",
        "text_rbjjCW"
      ],
