    "image_with_text_kYRQXe": {
      "type": "image-with-text",
      "blocks": {
        "heading_Kfr4cA": {
          "type": "heading",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Benefits for Businesses",
            "highlight_style": "none",
            "highlight_font_style": "italic",
            "highlight_style_color": "",
            "highlight_text_color": "",
            "heading_size": "h2"
          }
        },
        "text_qRqChX": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Investing in tamper-evident labels yields numerous benefits for businesses. Beyond reducing the risk of product tampering and minimizing liability, these labels enhance brand reputation and credibility.</p><p>Tamper-evident labels, including basic packaging tape, carton sealing tape, chip-away flaky material, and perforated labels, can all be customized with a customer’s logo or message. This customization ensures enhanced security and serves as a powerful branding tool across industries.</p><p>While there may be varying degrees of cost and complexity, the long-term ROI of implementing effective tamper-evident labeling strategies is undeniable.</p>",
            "subtext_color": true
          }
        }
      },
      "block_order": [
        "heading_Kfr4cA",
        "text_qRqChX"
      ],
      "name": "t:sections.image-with-text.name",
      "settings": {
