    "rich_text_pqfkUj": {
      "type": "rich-text",
      "blocks": {
        "heading_8ynJM7": {
          "type": "heading",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "A Symbol of Trust",
            "highlight_style": "none",
            "highlight_font_style": "italic",
            "highlight_style_color": "",
            "highlight_text_color": "",
            "heading_size": "h2"
          }
        },
        "text_HtFdDF": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Tamper-evident labels are not just a security measure; they’re a symbol of trust and reliability.</p><p>With 35 years of experience, NADCO knows this and specializes in providing a range of customizable tamper-evident label solutions. Clients can choose from various designs, materials, adhesives, and printing techniques to tailor labels to their specific needs.</p><p>With the right expertise, businesses can safeguard their products and protect their brand integrity in an increasingly complex market landscape.</p>",
            "text_size": "text-base",
            "text_line_limit": "none",
            "button_style": "btn--underline",
            "button_icon": "none"
          }
        }
      },
